comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T17:10:23.582Z",codex-agent,"Schema-negotiation validation reproduced this existing default-profile health mismatch with pinned host 2026.10.20 and installed pm-github 2026.10.23. Strict health passed with a disposable isolated global profile, and fresh CI tracker-health jobs passed on Node 22 and 26. No SDK pin, global extension, history or telemetry configuration was changed. The existing toolchain follow-up remains open."
  "2026-11-09T10:04:42.252Z",codex-agent,"PR 231 review verification reproduces the existing local host/extension skew with the pinned SDK: strict health reports extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew:2026.11.5:2026.11.8:pm-github. No package pin or extension installation was changed. Strict health with an isolated global tracker passes all ten checks (one advisory pending telemetry queue); tracked storage/history and merge drivers are healthy. Retain this separate toolchain follow-up; review fixes remain scoped to activation reuse and join dependency fencing."
